---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import martina from '../images/martina.png'
import shadow from '../images/shadow-database.png'
import table from '../images/create-table.png'
import { SITE_TITLE, SITE_DESCRIPTION } from '../consts';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title={SITE_TITLE} description={SITE_DESCRIPTION} />
	
		<style>

.hero-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr;
            gap: 40px;
            align-items: center;
            margin-bottom: 2em;
        }

        .hero-content h1 {
            margin-top: 0;
        }

        .hero-image {
            text-align: center;
        }

        .hero-image img {
            max-width: 300px;
            width: 100%;
            height: auto;
            border-radius: 8px;
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .hero-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
                gap: 20px;
                text-align: center;
            }
            
            .hero-image {
                order: -1; /* Put image above text on mobile */
            }
        }
			.skills-section {
				display: grid;
				grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(400px, 1fr));
				gap: 20px;
				margin: 40px 0;
			}
	
			.skill-card {
				background: #fff;
				border-radius: 8px;
				padding: 25px;
				box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
				transition: transform 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;
				border-left: 4px solid;
			}
	
			.skill-card:hover {
				transform: translateY(-2px);
				box-shadow: 0 8px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);
			}
	
			.skill-card { border-left-color: var(--link); }
	
			.skill-card h3 {
				font-size: 1.8rem;
				line-height:2.5rem;
				color: rgb(var(--black));
				margin-bottom: 12px;
				font-weight: 600;
				font-family: "Share Tech", sans-serif;
				padding: 0;
				margin: 0;
			}
	
			.skill-card p {
				color: rgb(var(--gray-dark));
				line-height: 1.5;
			}
	
			@media (max-width: 768px) {
				.skills-section {
					grid-template-columns: 1fr;
				}
			}
		</style>
	
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main>

			<div class="hero-grid">
				<div class="hero-content">
					<h1>It's-a me, Martina!</h1>
					<div class="prose">
						<p>I am a programmer-turned-technical writer and <strong>I specialize in developer documentation and DocOps</strong>. I love long walks on the beach and complex legacy code bases.</p>
						<p>Are you in a documentation pickle? Message me on <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/martinawelander/">LinkedIn</a> or drop me a line at 📨 <a href="mailto:martinawelander@gmail.com">martinawelander@gmail.com</a></a>.</p>
					</p> 
											</div>
				</div>
				
				<div class="hero-image">
					<Image src={martina} alt="A black-and-white selfie of Martina, who is smiling wide" width="300"/>
				</div>
			</div>
			
<h2>How can I help you?</h2>

<section class="skills-section">
	<div class="skill-card">
		<h3>Developer docs written by a developer</h3>
		<p>I write developer docs that are relevant and useful, with examples that work. As a bonus, I can act as customer zero for new features, APIs, or workflows.</p>
	</div>

	<div class="skill-card">
		<h3>Old codebase, no API documentation? No problem.</h3>
		<p>Give me your codebase, minimal context, and a cup of coffee or 10 - I'll reverse-engineer it to create comprehensive API documentation.</p>
	</div>

	<div class="skill-card">
		<h3>Capture ad-hoc developer onboarding processes as docs</h3>
		<p>Onboard me as a new developer - I will ask annoying questions and write down eveything you wished you had written down 10 hires ago.</p>
	</div>

	<div class="skill-card">
		<h3>DocOps: Docs-as-code and API docs in your existing CI/CD pipeline</h3>
		<p>I can help you extend your CI/CD pipeline to generate and publish API docs, or help you start managing your docs as code: everything from migrating to source control to automatically publishing changes on merge.</p>
	</div>

	<div class="skill-card">
		<h3>Distill complex systems into digestible overviews</h3>
		<p>Sometimes it's not enough 'just to read the code' - especially if you have a large, distributed system. I craft overviews that everyone from product owners to QA to new developers can benefit from.</p>
	</div>



	<div class="skill-card">
		<h3>All your technical writing needs</h3>
		<p>API reference, architecture overviews, tutorials, or detailed procedures - I create documentation that developers trust and actually use.</p>
	</div>

</section>	
</div>

<p>If you want to add a bit of <strong>💅creative flair</strong> to your docs, I also <a href="https://www.prisma.io/docs/assets/images/shadow-database-4851f4376ca80c1b94316445aa5bd85b.png">draw comics</a> and write <a href="/blog/what-are-cookies-and-how-do-they-work/">technical blog posts with hand-drawn illustrations</a>.</p>


<h2>Work history</h2>


I currently work as a <a href="https://tactilegames.com/martina-welander/">Technical Writer</a> at <a href="https://www.tactilegames.com/">Tactile Games</a>, and previously as an Education Engineer at <a href="http://www.prisma.io/">Prisma</a> and a Programmer Writer at <a href="https://sitecore.com/">Sitecore</a> (C#, .NET Core).
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>
